{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Y8V8BH581MA5KRT57MSB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランス、パリでのパフォーマンス\n今になっても忘れられないステージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして国を超えて\n海外のBuddiesの皆さんにも\n愛してもらえること本当に幸せです。\n日本からも沢山の方が\n駆けつけて下さりました。感謝してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5Y9VQ619XC7BXC02MCH36","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5YAW5XBHV49HG4RPJYRCR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスは白夜で暗くなるのが遅いので\nゆっくり時間が過ぎていく感じが素敵でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街を歩いているだけで気分はパリジェンヌ❤️‍🔥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5YBXSV4FGMYXSZXVDA443","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街の方も目が合うと、\nニコッとして下さったり、\n日本語を話して下さったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく\nグループにとって素敵な経験でした。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5YCWMYHF8F0H23F52XN1H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てんかりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5YDYQMXRVJ4NRYEKKA1HE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから色々連れて行ってあげたい😍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日\nJapan Expo in マレーシアです\nリハーサルも終えこのあと本番ということで\nドキドキですが頑張ってきます ☀️"}],"source":"archive"}